  resultsList:
  - index: 1
    newsTitle: DANDY DOES IN OLD DUFFER
    newsImg: {fileID: -7108302536350650008, guid: 4d6cc64f815d8d54a86d2cdad38c0f32, type: 3}
    lettersList:
    - "To the loathsome, wretched writer of The Weekly Wag,  \r\n\r\nYou cad!  \r\nYou
      pauper!  \r\nYou insolent wretch! \r\n\r\nFirst, you show up at my home- unannounced!
      - to harass and badger my family! \r\nThen, you accuse me- whilst I am in the
      throes of grief- of murdering my beloved brother! \r\nThen - WORST OF ALL \u2013
      you condemn me to a life of manacles and striped jumpsuits!  \r\n\r\n Rudeness
      I can forgive, even incarceration- but stripes?!? You have ruined me, sir!
      And I shall have my revenge!  \r\n\r\n My bunkmate- a most endearing fellow
      who goes by the name \u201CGinger Beer\u201D- has helped me craft my first
      shiv. You can be assured that upon my inevitable release from this cell, I
      will seek you out with the express intention of giving you a thorough pricking! 
      \r\n\r\n My idiotic warden tells me that I am only permitted to send one letter
      a month. Well, let me tell you this, SIR- you can expect another letter from
      me one month hence, detailing the many other ways in which I will make you
      suffer!  \r\n\r\nYour Mortal Enemy, \n\r\nMaximillian Hold "
    - Fantastic article kid! Couldn't have written it better myself!
